  "question": {
    "text": "If the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is symmetric about the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, then the value of the integral <math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
