  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is symmetric about <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math> we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Replacing <math><mi>x</mi></math> by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math><br />Now, using&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> property in <math><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo></math> and adding, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
  }
